  "sentences": [
    {"text": "Thick, clinging fog rolled in from the sea and took the harbour house by house.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A thin, pearly mist hovered above the meadow, and the cows stood knee-deep in it.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Pale, ghostly tendrils coiled around the gravestones.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A dense, grey blanket smothered the town.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Thin, wispy veils drifted across the road in the beam of the headlights.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Vague, shadowy shapes loomed out of the murk and became, at the last moment, only trees.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A blurred, yellow halo hung around each street lamp.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A low, mournful foghorn sounded across the bay.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "A cold, clammy dampness clung to her hair and beaded her eyelashes.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The fog swallowed the far bank, then the bridge, then the water itself.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "It muffled every sound, so that her own footsteps seemed to come from someone else.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A soft, milky haze veiled the valley at dawn.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The mist lifted by mid-morning, and the hills came back.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The last, lingering wisps dissolved in the sunlight.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "He groped his way forward through the impenetrable, swirling murk, one hand on the wall.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The fog closed in behind them, and the world was reduced to a blank, white silence.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Vapour curled above the river like steam from a cup.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The fog thickened by the minute.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A sudden wind tore the fog into rags and sent it streaming over the cliff.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The sea fog came on so fast that the fishing boats ran for harbour.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Somewhere a dog barked, sounding a hundred miles away.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The lighthouse vanished, and with it the last proof that anyone else existed.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Something moved at the edge of sight, and the mist closed over it again.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Mist crept up from the marsh at dusk and lay along the lane like something waiting.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The sun rose behind the mist, a pale, perfect coin.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Every cobweb in the hedge was strung with tiny drops.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The lake lay under its mist as if asleep.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "In the early morning the fields were soft-edged and quiet.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Outlines blurred, and the houses across the street faded to grey.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A bank of fog shrouded the motorway, and the traffic slowed to a crawl.", "vibe": "General"}
  ]
